{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46149","headline":"送新罗人及第归 · 贯休","name":"送新罗人及第归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捧桂香和紫禁烟，远乡程彻巨鳌边。\n莫言挂席飞连夜，见说无风即数年。\n衣上日光真是火，岛旁鱼骨大於船。\n到乡必遇来王使，与作唐书寄一篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}